# Where dev/score-generator.mjs writes its tables. The DIRECTORY is committed (this file is
# the whole reason it exists in git) and its contents are not: a run output is a measurement
# of one afternoon, it is regenerated by re-running the scorer, and a repository full of them
# turns "what was the before number" into a question about which file somebody opened.
#
# The numbers that matter get quoted in a commit message or the work log, where they sit
# beside the change they measure.
*
!.gitignore
